            <ArticleTitle>Pain management by contralateral local anaesthesia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>139-42</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Contralateral local anaesthesia is presented as a possible means of pain management in the form of case studies. Results in the treatment of phantom-limb pains was particularly favourable. The efficacy of contralateral local anaesthesia was also shown in acute postoperative pain states.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
